cyrus-sasl-oauth2-oidc (1.0.2-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Extend fallback config file to support all OAuth2 options
  * Fix memory leaks in fallback config (singular/plural forms)
  * Secure clearing of client_secret before freeing memory
  * Consistent config priority: SASL getopt > fallback > defaults
  * Updated Postfix documentation

 -- Stephane Benoit <stefb@wizzz.net>  Thu, 27 Feb 2026 12:00:00 +0100

cyrus-sasl-oauth2-oidc (1.0.1-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Fix plugin initialization failure with SASL tools
  * Add fallback configuration file support (/etc/sasl2/oauth2.conf)
  * Detect XOAUTH2 vs OAUTHBEARER authentication type
  * Allow additional parameters in OAUTHBEARER
  * Fix liboauth2 >= 2.2.0 API compatibility
  * Fix configure.ac API detection for RPM builds

 -- Stephane Benoit <stefb@wizzz.net>  Wed, 03 Dec 2025 10:00:00 +0100

cyrus-sasl-oauth2-oidc (1.0.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package release
  * OAuth2/OIDC SASL plugin for Cyrus SASL
  * Support for Bearer token authentication
  * OpenID Connect ID token validation
  * JWT token introspection capabilities
  * Multiple issuer and audience support
  * Compatible with Debian Trixie

